== block 5: the table of the data against the human (Remark 3.2a)
  X = [N], one call per run; human f = 0 with weight 2^-K; for every set A the member
  '0 on A, 1 elsewhere' with weight c (2N)^-|A|, c = (1 - 2^-K)/(1 + 1/(2N))^N;
  after s distinct questions: Pr[the mixture answers 1 at an input not yet asked]
